=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"626\" height=\"417\" src=\"https:\/\/gardensexecutiveclub.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/business-woman-working-laptop-talking-phone_1303-9734.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-519\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gardensexecutiveclub.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/business-woman-working-laptop-talking-phone_1303-9734.jpg 626w, https:\/\/gardensexecutiveclub.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/business-woman-working-laptop-talking-phone_1303-9734-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 626px) 100vw, 626px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8015b59 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"8015b59\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b95fa6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6b95fa6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"header__SubHeaderBody_-ytscf2-7 fFUhXk\"><strong>To:<\/strong> The Gardens Executive Club Membership\u00a0<br \/><strong>Subject:<\/strong> Quarterly Candidacy Dinners<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><div>Dear Garden&#8217;s Executive Club Candidate\u00a0<br \/><br \/>\u00a0As your President and Chief Executive Officer, I am honored to extend this official call of candidacy for attending our Quarterly Membership Inquiry Dinner.\u00a0 Come together for a time of Vision &amp; Mission enlightenment, sponsorship opportunities, business collaboration, acknowledgment of accomplishments and great fellowship while witnessing other potential GEC members being able to experience the fine dining and networking opportunities of Garden&#8217;s Executives from every high-income industry.<br \/><br \/>\u00a0The Garden\u2019s Executive Club is a Private Women\u2019s Club for C-Suite Level Executives, Presidents, Vice Presidents, and CEO&#8217;s and it has plans for Global Domination. You will also be able to witness the virtual induction of National Members from across the US.\u00a0<br \/><br \/>The Garden\u2019s Executive Club, Inc., founded by Ebony Ormond-Ham, has planted its first power seed in the vintage tourism attractions of downtown Stone Mountain; within a 2 mile radius of Stone Mountain Park\u2019s West Gate entrance. A 2-story, 6,000-square-foot, 2acre, tribute to female executives.<br \/><br \/><br \/>Our Quarterly Membership Dinners are hosted by the Garden&#8217;s Executive Advisory Board and it&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer, Ebony Ormond-Ham. A completed application, a $250 initial membership fee (non-refundable), a professional photo ID (Headshot), and a company Electronic Press Kit will be required for consideration of Membership. Upon acceptance of application, a media\/press consent of release, credit card authorization form, and a non-disclosure will be a forthcoming requirement.<br \/><br \/>Non-Attendance of our candidacy dinners will not prevent GEC MEMBERSHIP.\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dfeb214 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"dfeb214\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/d